{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darkest Mine is a roguelite action-plateformer featuring some RPG elements and played in 20-minutes-long runs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/MOV-GIF1.gif?t=1741849956\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_1-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive down 5 depth levels made of 10 rooms each. You must clear a room entirely before progressing to the next one, until you reach the depth level's boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/MOV-GIF2.gif?t=1741849956\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_2-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 3 rooms, you get a pick from more than 100 different abilities, each one affecting your gamleplay in a specific way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/MOV-GIF3.gif?t=1741849956\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_3-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 weapons are available, providing 4 completely unique playstyles for your runs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/MOV-GIF4.gif?t=1741849956\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_4-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the gold nuggets you will collect through your runs, you can purchase permanent upgrades at the blacksmith </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/MOV-GIF5.gif?t=1741849956\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_5-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local co-op and Steam Play Together are both available if you want to add a 2nd player to the run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_Discord-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Startly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3172400/691d9992fbd9f9123266f34f2cfb88748e89f8d7.jpg"},{"name":"Firstly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3172400/ffce25c0ff47b60c3ddae595e2b51e3bdb9820e5.jpg"},{"name":"Secondly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3172400/d8867991917984b040b8def24240c1d838e53da9.jpg"},{"name":"Thirdly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3172400/94b400bc5253a8d052b5288d4bfd075d0e6b6229.jpg"},{"name":"Finally","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3172400/61e2b496a42f6192351ab3747bfcaee0021192bd.jpg"},{"name":"Pickaxely","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3172400/56cc62b9b60f5fcd1b1f1ef7dc0b0bb53819233a.jpg"},{"name":"Spearly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3172400/5264b364c5b0a98927a099a69ade400365330198.jpg"},{"name":"Drilly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3172400/16a67713ad811ab06813dda67cb675ed3f203f35.jpg"},{"name":"Slingshotly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3172400/ee6bd5ac4555f89fbc22c339291ba091dc2e1461.jpg"},{"name":"Deeply 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3172400/abff651d135ca9ed59a487901ba6aec9b0022658.jpg"}],"total":44},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3172400?t=1741849956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3172400?t=1741849956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/85ce2e93a4f363e30dc45cb3f4039fe89bd785bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741849956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/85ce2e93a4f363e30dc45cb3f4039fe89bd785bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741849956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3193570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darkest Mine is a roguelite action-plateformer featuring some RPG elements and played in 20-minutes-long runs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/MOV-GIF1.gif?t=1741849956\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_1-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive down 5 depth levels made of 10 rooms each. You must clear a room entirely before progressing to the next one, until you reach the depth level's boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/MOV-GIF2.gif?t=1741849956\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_2-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 3 rooms, you get a pick from more than 100 different abilities, each one affecting your gamleplay in a specific way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/MOV-GIF3.gif?t=1741849956\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_3-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 weapons are available, providing 4 completely unique playstyles for your runs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/MOV-GIF4.gif?t=1741849956\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_4-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the gold nuggets you will collect through your runs, you can purchase permanent upgrades at the blacksmith </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/MOV-GIF5.gif?t=1741849956\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_5-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local co-op and Steam Play Together are both available if you want to add a 2nd player to the run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/extras/Divider_Discord-EN.png?t=1741849956\" /></p>","developers":["Crazy Rooster Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172400/header.jpg?t=1741849956","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257046794,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046794/movie480.mp4?t=1724776211","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046794/movie_max.mp4?t=1724776211"},"name":"Darkest Mine Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257046794/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1724776211","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046794/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1724776211","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046794/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1724776211"}}],"name":"Darkest Mine","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Darkest Mine - $4.99 USD","packageid":1125574,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":499}],"title":"Buy Darkest Mine"}],"packages":[1125574],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB, OpenGL 3+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 54 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"wi